Dillon, M., Rivera, J., Darbin, R., Clinger, B., “Maximizing U.S. Army Return on Investment Utilizing Software Product- Line Approach,” Interservice/Industry Training, Simulation, and Education Conference (I/ITSEC), 2012.

QA3 - 0.5. Experiences with the first generation of product lines based on authors experiences and cost avoidance metrics. Challenges about the SOA adaptation uses metrics such as the reuse factor

QA4 - 1. RQ2 few details about the challenges faced with the first generation of product lines. RQ3 - cost avoidance- RQ4- Technical details. RQ5. Chart comparing the cost avoidance with the first and second generation of produc lines.

